2383-435c-8be4-dd6fb3007daa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf79abdc340fd59b1067d5687a41e768", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/76d581be/uploads/origins/0f6e8610-2383-435c-8be4-dd6fb3007daa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bc4dd8f9581c4ac75ed4767977e332de", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi sensei! I really like your art— especially your couple art! I would be very happy if you could draw my OC pairing (girl belongs to my friend): https://sta.sh/21wup1f3wyma?edit=1\n\n🌼Suisei: The girl is quiet but kind! She is very expressive. \n\n☁️Shu: The boy is cheerful and overly familiar. He has many friends and is used to talking to others.\n\nRelationship: The boy is very comfortable around the girl so he can do things like leaning against her, sleeping on her shoulder and more! But the girl is shy and her heart always beats very fast. She likes him but he doesn’t know that. The boy only treats her as a friend.\n\nSensei can draw freely! Sensei can even draw a sketch interaction too if you want (like this: https://twitter.com/umeeemomo/status/1632374334827421697?s=21&t=bTukIuX9dpo7lOik73Ceww) \n\nIdeas:\n-The boy sees the girl and he waves at her with a smile. The girl is startled but waves shyly back. \n-The boy leans on the girl’s shoulder and sleeps. She tries not to move.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21wup1f3wyma?edit=1", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 4049, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みつきつみ🌛", "screen_name": "mitsuki_tsumi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/966194413088239617/wjfgMxeR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/963405025421623296/1520143728/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_ma